{"3889510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "They Took the Sun", "steam_appid": 3889510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They took everything. Your ship is all you have left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track them down through the remains of Earth and stop them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/dd62f9b5aafb4b39f44816b338bc5cea.poster.avif?t=1777984981\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/dd62f9b5aafb4b39f44816b338bc5cea.webm?t=1777984981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/dd62f9b5aafb4b39f44816b338bc5cea.mp4?t=1777984981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong><br><br>What <strong>is</strong> in the game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique boss encounters with each their own mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, intuitive arcade flight mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast environments to get lost in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal, eerie, dreamlike mood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ethereal soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/dd078e50a5870f95996cc71b1ff40ccd.poster.avif?t=1777984981\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/dd078e50a5870f95996cc71b1ff40ccd.webm?t=1777984981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/dd078e50a5870f95996cc71b1ff40ccd.mp4?t=1777984981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What <strong>is not</strong> in the game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complex upgrade system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No regular enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a flight sim, not a rail shooter either</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No dialogue</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In a nutshell</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can think of <i><strong>They Took the Sun</strong></i> as a mix between 90s arcade flight games and Team Ico’s <i>Shadow of the Colossus</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/a6dd824fede30809a5aee3f5ae37dc89.poster.avif?t=1777984981\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/a6dd824fede30809a5aee3f5ae37dc89.webm?t=1777984981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/a6dd824fede30809a5aee3f5ae37dc89.mp4?t=1777984981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dev Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gabe Miller - Art &amp; Design <br>Julien Ribassin - Audio, Code &amp; Design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/8e70d1eed63c9abcefbf3642f9fdde0c.avif?t=1777984981\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They took everything. Your ship is all you have left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track them down through the remains of Earth and stop them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/dd62f9b5aafb4b39f44816b338bc5cea.poster.avif?t=1777984981\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/dd62f9b5aafb4b39f44816b338bc5cea.webm?t=1777984981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/dd62f9b5aafb4b39f44816b338bc5cea.mp4?t=1777984981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong><br><br>What <strong>is</strong> in the game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique boss encounters with each their own mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, intuitive arcade flight mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast environments to get lost in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal, eerie, dreamlike mood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ethereal soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/dd078e50a5870f95996cc71b1ff40ccd.poster.avif?t=1777984981\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/dd078e50a5870f95996cc71b1ff40ccd.webm?t=1777984981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/dd078e50a5870f95996cc71b1ff40ccd.mp4?t=1777984981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What <strong>is not</strong> in the game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complex upgrade system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No regular enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a flight sim, not a rail shooter either</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No dialogue</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In a nutshell</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can think of <i><strong>They Took the Sun</strong></i> as a mix between 90s arcade flight games and Team Ico’s <i>Shadow of the Colossus</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/a6dd824fede30809a5aee3f5ae37dc89.poster.avif?t=1777984981\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/a6dd824fede30809a5aee3f5ae37dc89.webm?t=1777984981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889510/extras/a6dd824fede30809a5aee3f5ae37dc89.mp4?t=1777984981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dev Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gabe Miller - Art &amp; Design <br>Julien Ribassin - Audio, Code &amp; Design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_